{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "截距 b 如何平移直线 y=2x+b",
    "goals": [
      "理解直线 y=2x+b 中截距 b 的几何意义：它决定了直线与 y 轴交点 (0, b)",
      "掌握当 b 改变时，直线保持斜率不变、整体沿 y 轴进行上下平移"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "代入特殊点 x=0 寻找截距的本质理由",
        "通过动态改变参数 b 观察直线整体平行移动的过程",
        "结合操作练习巩固对截距几何意义的理解"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": -4,
        "max": 4,
        "label": "b",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.04
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "请拖动滑块，把截距 b 的值调整为 2。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "关注滑块的数值，向右拖动增大 b 的值。",
          "当 b=2 时，直线与 y 轴交于点 (0, 2)。"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "做得很准！此时交点正是 (0, 2)，直线相比原来平行上移了 2 个单位。",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 2,
          "tolerance": 0.02
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "通过直观动态演示弄清截距 b 如何决定直线在 y 轴的交点并带动整条线上下平移",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们来看直线方程 y=2x+b。寻找一个参数的几何意义，最简洁的方法是看特殊点：当 x 等于 0 时，y 就直接等于 b。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "函数图像",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -10,
                    "max": 10,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((2)*(x))+(number_01)",
                    "label": "y=2x+b"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "reference-a",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "reference-b",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 2,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "reference-a.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(0))+(number_01)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "reference-b.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(1))+(number_01)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant",
                "sample_input": "fixed_x"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x=0 \\implies y=b"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "这说明无论 b 怎么变，直线与 y 轴的交点坐标永远是 (0, b)。当前 b=0，直线经过原点 (0, 0)。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "截距 b 的几何意义",
                "items": [
                  "与 y 轴交点为 (0, b)",
                  "斜率保持为 2 不变",
                  "b 增大向上平移，b 减小向下平移"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "聚焦在直线与 y 轴的交点",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "现在我们把 b 增加到 3。注意观察：直线倾斜的角度丝毫没有改变，整条线向上平行移动，交点来到了 (0, 3)。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 3,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "接着我们把 b 减小到 -2。直线的倾斜程度依然不变，交点向下移动到了 (0, -2)。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": -2,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "这就得出了结论：截距 b 控制直线在 y 轴上的位置，改变 b 相当于整体上下平移。课后请你亲自试一下：把滑块上的截距 b 调整到 2，观察直线与 y 轴的交点位置。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "在直线方程 y=2x+b 中，斜率 2 决定倾斜程度，而截距 b 决定了直线与 y 轴相交于点 (0, b)。改变 b 的值不会改变直线的方向，只会让直线沿 y 轴平行上下平移。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
